## 1. Objective
The objective of Day 6 was to deploy and administer a functional Linux web server using Nginx on an existing Ubuntu Server virtual machine.
The exercise focused on understanding how web servers operate, how network services communicate over TCP ports, how Linux firewalls control incoming traffic, and how to diagnose and recover from a web service outage.
By the end of the exercise, the server successfully hosted a custom HTML webpage accessible from a separate Windows workstation.

